  "code": "use IO.Std.write_line\nuse Concurrency\n\nlet ready = AtomicBool(false)\n\n// queued task work, run by this thread when it next waits\nConcurrency.Future.run(() is ready.store(true) si)\n\nlet worker = start(() -> string is\n    while !ready.load() do\n        Concurrency.sleep(1)\n    od\n\n    return \"the queued work ran during the join\"\nsi)\n\nwrite_line(worker.join())",
